 * caret and per-slot state). Layout variants from Figma — Digits Only, With
 * Separator, Simple, With Spacing — are compositions of Group / Slot /
 * Separator. State Default / Invalid is driven by `aria-invalid`; per-slot
 * Focus / Filled / Disabled come from the engine.
